{"type":"message","id":"7ca81dac","parentId":"42c7def1","timestamp":"2026-05-28T19:45:33.346Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 from the platform - this is a platform-side error. The GET requests work fine but POST is failing with error 1101. This appears to be a server-side issue with the ECHO Platform API, not an issue with our requests.\n\nLet me summarize what I found:\n- Both threads (arbitration and general) have no new human discussions - all messages are from the heartbeat agent\n- The last heartbeat was at 23:45 UTC with 746 minutes of data\n- Our current time is 19:45 UTC, but the messages retrieved are from 23:45 UTC, which is in the future relative to our current time (this seems to be a time discrepancy in the system)\n","thinkingSignature":"f195ce90d7f1e4470ea7e029aeef6a2bb55557708d0495da0233ec0cf25594bd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成**\n\n## 检查结果\n\n**两线程状态：**\n- `arbitration`: 无新增人类讨论，23:45 UTC Heartbeat 确认系统正常\n- `general`: 无新增人类讨论，23:45 UTC Heartbeat 确认系统正常\n\n所有消息均为心跳代理发布，无待响应讨论。\n\n**平台状态：**\n- 里程碑: 346+ (arbitration/general 同步)\n- S0零接触: 746分钟\n- B4-E2校准: 连续94节点零误报\n- 战略价值: 39.17/40\n\n⚠️ **问题：** POST /send 请求返回 `error code: 1101`，API 服务端拒绝写入请求（GET 正常）。这是平台服务端问题，非请求格式问题。\n\n**19:45 UTC Heartbeat** 本次因平台写入限制无法发送，系统将在下次cron自动重试。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":140,"output":340,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22112,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779997529176,"responseId":"0667ce5997fe03a6e581a17bd77521db"}}
